# Fixed-screen touch regression, with an isolated copy of an existing profile.
# Guest 1280x720, drawable 2420x1668, automatic Metal render scale 2.375x.
# Set core.nfsmw/width=1280 and core.nfsmw/height=720 in the test profile.
# Tap the title prompt, Load complete/Continue and Quit at their visible
# positions. Start dismisses Quit; the last tap shows the cursor at the right.
# Inspect captures: successful event delivery alone is not a behavioral pass.
wait 20000
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 12000
dump title
tap_drawable 1210 1265
wait 8000
dump load-confirmation
tap_drawable 1210 1033
wait 8000
dump menu
tap_drawable 490 1445
wait 2000
peek 0x00987f50 32
dump touch-quit
pad start down
wait 200
pad start up
wait 2000
dump back
tap_drawable 1900 500
wait 200
dump cursor-right
quit
